/T (Focus Power Fit centralizes gym operations through a CRM-oriented web platform. The system organizes branches, users, clients, instructors, plans, schedules, attendance, contracts, payments, and reminders within one environment. It provides role-based access, process traceability, and agile queries for administrators and clients. The solution uses React, TypeScript, Node.js, Express, Sequelize, and Redis, supported by containerized deployment. The MVP excludes online payments and instructor accounts, prioritizing control, usability, security, and a scalable technical foundation for future integrations. This approach reduces fragmented records, improves operational visibility, and supports consistent, evidence-based management across the organization and its daily services.)
/E (Focus Power Fit centralizes gym operations through a CRM-oriented web platform. The system organizes branches, users, clients, instructors, plans, schedules, attendance, contracts, payments, and reminders within one environment. It provides role-based access, process traceability, and agile queries for administrators and clients. The solution uses React, TypeScript, Node.js, Express, Sequelize, and Redis, supported by containerized deployment. The MVP excludes online payments and instructor accounts, prioritizing control, usability, security, and a scalable technical foundation for future integrations. This approach reduces fragmented records, improves operational visibility, and supports consistent, evidence-based management across the organization and its daily services.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
